 begin="01:10.360" end="01:13.510"><span begin="01:10.360" end="01:11.147">Ya </span><span begin="01:11.147" end="01:11.934">soshla </span><span begin="01:11.934" end="01:12.721">s </span><span begin="01:12.721" end="01:13.510">uma</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.510" end="01:13.930"><span begin="01:13.510" end="01:13.615">This </span><span begin="01:13.615" end="01:13.720">is </span><span begin="01:13.720" end="01:13.825">not </span><span begin="01:13.825" end="01:13.930">enough</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.930" end="01:14.590"><span begin="01:13.930" end="01:14.062">All </span><span begin="01:14.062" end="01:14.194">the </span><span begin="01:14.194" end="01:14.326">things </span><span begin="01:14.326" end="01:14.458">she </span><span begin="01:14.458" end="01:14.590">said</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.590" end="01:15.490"><span begin="01:14.590" end="01:14.770">All </span><span begin="01:14.770" end="01:14.950">the </span><span begin="01:14.950" end="01:15.130">things </span><span begin="01:15.130" end="01:15.310">she </span><span begin="01:15.310" end="01:15.490">said</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.020" end="01:18.070"><span begin="01:17.020" end="01:17.230">All </span><span begin="01:17.230" end="01:17.350">the </span><span begin="01:17.350" end="01:17.530">things </span><span begin="01:17.530" end="01:17.650">she </span><span begin="01:17.650" end="01:18.070">said</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.070" end="01:19.390"><span begin="01:18.070" end="01:18.220">All </span><span begin="01:18.220" end="01:18.340">the </span><span begin="01:18.340" end="01:18.580">things </span><span begin="01:18.580" end="01:18.640">she </span><span begin="01:18.640" end="01:19.390">said</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.160" end="01:30.640"><span begin="01:30.160" end="01:30.256">All </span><span begin="01:30.256" end="01:30.352">the </span><span begin="01:30.352" end="01:30.448">things </span><span begin="01:30.448" end="01: